WEBVTT

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:09.560
Welcome to Steadfast Men.
This is training for men.

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:13.040
You'll hear some teaching
and then you'll go practice it.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.400
It's for every man watching this.

00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:21.241
Married, single, divorced, new dad,
or your kids are taller than you now.

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:25.581
If you've walked with Jesus for 30 years,
you belong here.

00:00:26.441 --> 00:00:29.801
If you're not sure what you think
about Him yet, you belong here too.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:34.884
Here's the road you're about to walk.
24 sessions.

00:00:35.764 --> 00:00:37.576
We start with ordinary days

00:00:37.576 --> 00:00:40.664
because that's where
a man actually gets made.

00:00:41.524 --> 00:00:43.250
Four marks sit in front of you.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:49.124
Stop waiting, pick up the weight,
go first, and work for God's pay.

00:00:49.984 --> 00:00:52.821
That pay is something God gives His kids.

00:00:52.821 --> 00:00:55.105
Nobody earns his way in with it.

00:00:55.985 --> 00:00:59.555
Then we look back at your dad,
the home you came out of,

00:00:59.555 --> 00:01:04.325
the friends you don't really have,
and what's broken inside every one of us.

00:01:05.185 --> 00:01:09.565
Then Genesis:
what God had in mind when He made a man.

00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:14.258
Then home: your wife,
or the wife you don't have yet,

00:01:14.258 --> 00:01:17.565
sex, your daughters, your sons.

00:01:18.666 --> 00:01:21.966
What I hope you walk away with
isn't a stack of notes.

00:01:22.526 --> 00:01:26.882
I want you to see, plain,
what God built a man for.

00:01:26.882 --> 00:01:29.746
Look honestly at what you were handed.

00:01:30.146 --> 00:01:32.587
Have a few men who actually know you.

00:01:32.587 --> 00:01:37.846
And do some real moves in your real life
that somebody at home noticed.

00:01:38.946 --> 00:01:41.986
1 Corinthians 15:58.

00:01:42.846 --> 00:01:48.410
Therefore, my dear brothers and sisters,
stand firm.

00:01:48.410 --> 00:01:50.890
Let nothing move you.

00:01:50.890 --> 00:01:54.620
Always give yourselves fully
to the work of the Lord,

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:59.467
because you know that your labor
in the Lord is not in vain.

00:02:00.350 --> 00:02:03.467
Fully.
That's the word I'd underline.

00:02:04.587 --> 00:02:09.219
And down the road, some of you are gonna
take a few men through this yourselves.

00:02:09.219 --> 00:02:10.847
I'd like that a lot.

00:02:11.941 --> 00:02:13.759
Before you start Lesson 1,

00:02:13.759 --> 00:02:16.901
here's how to use what's on this page
and on the site.

00:02:17.441 --> 00:02:18.841
Each lesson has a video.

00:02:19.481 --> 00:02:22.165
If you'd rather listen
while you drive or walk,

00:02:22.165 --> 00:02:25.161
there's an audio-only version
of the same lesson.

00:02:25.661 --> 00:02:29.442
And there's a transcript if you want
to read it or catch a line you missed.

00:02:29.882 --> 00:02:34.082
There's also a weekly workbook activity
you can download for that session.

00:02:34.602 --> 00:02:36.991
If you want the whole thing in one place,

00:02:36.991 --> 00:02:39.774
the complete workbook
is for sale on the site.

00:02:39.774 --> 00:02:42.622
That's the paper you take
with you into the week.

00:02:43.182 --> 00:02:45.654
The book that goes with all this
is there too.

00:02:45.654 --> 00:02:49.982
Same road as the sessions, written
so you can sit with it on your own.

00:02:50.822 --> 00:02:55.003
My friend Jonathon and I
do a podcast called Walk Steadfast.

00:02:55.463 --> 00:02:58.923
Same topics as these weeks,
just shorter and for the car.

00:02:59.383 --> 00:03:02.752
There's a YouTube channel off it as well
if you'd rather watch.

00:03:02.752 --> 00:03:07.623
We're at @steadfastwalk on the socials
if you want the week-to-week posts.

00:03:08.503 --> 00:03:11.043
One more ask,
and I'm not going to push it.

00:03:11.903 --> 00:03:14.939
If this work matters to you
and you're in a place

00:03:14.939 --> 00:03:18.843
to help it reach more men,
there's a place on the site to give.

00:03:19.303 --> 00:03:23.924
A donation helps keep the training,
the book, and the podcast going.

00:03:24.384 --> 00:03:27.424
Consider it.
No guilt if now isn't the time.

00:03:28.447 --> 00:03:32.188
Okay, stand firm.
Let's get to work.

